direction: right
Users: Users {shape: person}
CDN: CDN {shape: cloud}
Web: Web frontend {shape: page}
API: Application API {shape: rectangle}
Cache: Redis cache {shape: stored_data}
Database: Primary database {shape: cylinder}
Users -> CDN: HTTPS
CDN -> Web: static assets
Web -> API: JSON API
API -> Cache: hot reads
API -> Database: queries
Cache -> Database: cache miss
